kevins@aragorn.ori.org (Kevin Smolkowski) writes:

>There was a little more space on wuarchive today so I uploaded
>the following on behalf of the pc team.

>nh312386.exe - self extracting zip archive with a pc binary
>               compiled with djgpp 1.10.  No overlay slowdown,
>               but runs only on 386/486 machines.

